Subject: [PATCH 088/102] dt-bindings: clock: qcom: Add SM7250 display clock
 controller

The SM7250 display clock controller is the SM8250 one without the
second display PLL, the second DP link and eDP. The PLL1 input of its
muxes carries the GPLL0 display branch from GCC instead, so it needs a
different clock input list.

These changes were written with the help of an LLM and checked by a human.

Assisted-by: LLM dtschema
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RmfiVDW3KWZdb9c3iDGRYg
---
 .../bindings/clock/qcom,sm7250-dispcc.yaml    | 97 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 97 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/qcom,sm7250-dispcc.yaml

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/qcom,sm7250-dispcc.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/qcom,sm7250-dispcc.yaml
